        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana DKMV4, Modern Door Knocker With Viewer</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis modern viewer door knocker includes a 200 degree glass lens viewer for a less obvious way to add security to your home. Now you can safely see who is at your door before you open it. The glass viewer (peephole) has a 9/16\" diameter shaft and is UL Listed. This Deltana made modern styled door knocker is made of solid brass. It is thru-bolt mounted with  3-15/32\" center to center mounting holes (distance between the 2 mounting bolt holes). Includes 2 matching finish screws with 5/8\" diameter decorative screw bezels for easy installation. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/deltana-DKMV4-size.jpg?v=1704354583\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana DKMV4 Modern Door Knocker Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana DKMV4 Modern Door Knocker:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Height: 4-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers:  3-15/32 c.c.  (distance between the 2 mounting screw holes)</li>\r\n<li>Max Projection: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting: Thru-Bolted (Screws go thru the door)</li>\r\n<li>Includes matching finish 200 degree eye viewer.</li>\r\n<li>Includes matching finish mounting hardware.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DKMV4.pdf?v=1704262384\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana DKMV4 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
