                "description": "Deltana DKMV4 - This modern viewer door knocker includes a 200 degree glass lens viewer for a less obvious way to add security to your home. Now you can safely see who is at your door before you open it. The glass viewer (peephole) has a 9/16 inch diameter shaft. This Deltana made modern styled door knocker is made of solid brass in your choice of finish colors",
